---
layout: base.njk
title: Events
permalink: events.html
description: Upcoming festivals, pujas and programs at Shri Sanatan Mandir, Hutto TX — Navratri, Diwali, Ganesh Chaturthi, Janmashtami and more.
---
{% import "icons.njk" as icons %}
{%- set upcoming = collections.upcomingEvents %}
{%- set past = collections.pastEvents %}
{%- set next = upcoming | first %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="hindi" lang="hi">उत्सव एवं कार्यक्रम</span>
    <h1>Events &amp; Festivals</h1>
    <p>Everything happening at the mandir. Tap an event for its full details.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if next %}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="next-event" href="{{ next.url | rel }}" data-end="{{ next.data.endDate | evIso }}">
      <div class="next-event__media next-event__media--{{ next.data.picture.fit }}"><img src="{{ next.data.picture.src | rel }}" alt=""></div>
      <div class="next-event__body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Next at the mandir</span>
        <h2>{{ next.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="next-event__when">{{ icons.icon("calendar") }} {{ next.data.startDate | evLong }}{% if not next.data.allDay %} · {{ next.data.startDate | evTime }} – {{ next.data.endDate | evTime }}{% endif %}</p>
        {%- if next.data.summary %}<p class="muted">{{ next.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
        <span class="btn btn--red">Event details</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section" style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="container">
    {%- if upcoming.length == 0 %}
    <p class="events-empty">No upcoming events are posted yet — please check back soon or follow us on Facebook and WhatsApp.</p>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- for group in upcoming | byMonth %}
    <div class="month-heading"><h2>{{ group.label }}</h2></div>
    <div class="events-grid">
      {%- for ev in group.items %}{% include "event-tile.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="events-empty" data-events-none hidden>No more upcoming events right now — please check back soon.</p>

    {%- if past.length %}
    <details class="past-events">
      <summary>Past events ({{ past.length }})</summary>
      <div class="events-grid">
        {%- for ev in past %}{% include "event-tile.njk" %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:start">
    <div class="card card--red">
      <h2>Regular Schedule</h2>
      <ul class="hours-list">
        {%- for h in site.hours %}
        <li><b>{{ h.days }}</b><span>{{ h.times }}</span></li>
        {%- endfor %}
        <li><b>Evening Aarti</b><span>Daily — time to be confirmed</span></li>
        <li><b>Hanuman Chalisa</b><span>Saturdays — time to be confirmed</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="small" style="margin:14px 0 0;color:#f3e3c0">Special timings on festival days are posted as events above.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="placeholder">
        <p><b>Regular schedule still needed from the temple:</b> daily aarti times, weekly programs (Hanuman Chalisa, bhajan/satsang, Sunday puja), and monthly observances (Purnima, Ekadashi, Sankashti). The events shown are samples — see <code>docs/ADDING-EVENTS.md</code> to add real ones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px">
        <h3>Stay informed</h3>
        <p>Festival announcements also go out on the mandir's WhatsApp group and Facebook page.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn btn--red btn--sm" href="{{ site.social.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ icons.icon("whatsapp") }} Join WhatsApp group</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
